[TITLE]
InpWriter round-trip fixture: flap gates on structure links
Every structure here carries Gated YES, and the orifices additionally exercise
the columns the writer used to hardcode: O_BOT is a BOTTOM orifice (the writer
printed a literal "SIDE" for every row) and both orifices carry a non-zero
open/close time (the column was dropped entirely). The outlets cover BOTH
rating layouts, because the Gated column sits at a different token index in
each: TABULAR carries one rating column (the curve), FUNCTIONAL carries two.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/02/2020
END_TIME             00:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30
MIN_SLOPE            0

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT   0.0
DRY_ONLY   NO

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1       12.0  5.0       0          0         0
J2       11.0  5.0       0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type  StageData  Gated
O1       9.0   FREE  *          YES
O2       9.0   FREE  *          NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Length  Roughness  InOffset  OutOffset
C1       J1        J2      300.0   0.013      0         0

[ORIFICES]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Type    Offset  Cd    Gated  CloseTime
O_SIDE   J2        O1      SIDE    0.5     0.65  YES    1.5
O_BOT    J2        O2      BOTTOM  0.0     0.60  NO     2.25

[WEIRS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Type        CrestHt  Cd    Gated  EC  Cd2  Sur
W1       J2        O1      TRANSVERSE  1.0      3.33  YES    0   0    YES

[OUTLETS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Offset  Type              Rating       Gated
L_TAB    J2        O1      0.0     TABULAR/HEAD      RC1          YES
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Offset  Type              C1     C2     Gated
L_FUN    J2        O2      0.0     FUNCTIONAL/HEAD   10.0   0.5    YES

[LOSSES]
;;Link  Kentry  Kexit  Kavg  FlapGate  Seepage
C1       0       0      0     YES       0

[CURVES]
;;Name  Type    X-Value  Y-Value
RC1      RATING  0.0      0.0
RC1              1.0      5.0
RC1              2.0      9.0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape        Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C1       CIRCULAR     2.0    0      0      0      1
O_SIDE   RECT_CLOSED  1.0    1.0    0      0
O_BOT    RECT_CLOSED  1.0    1.0    0      0
W1       RECT_OPEN    1.0    2.0    0      0

[REPORT]
INPUT       NO
CONTROLS    NO
NODES       ALL
LINKS       ALL

[COORDINATES]
;;Node  X-Coord  Y-Coord
J1       0.0      0.0
J2       300.0    0.0
O1       600.0    0.0
O2       600.0    100.0
